sequenceDiagram
  participant SCIMClient as SCIM Client (IdP/HRIS)
  participant API as SCIM REST API
  participant Validator as SCIM Schema Validator
  participant Service as ScimProvisioningService
  participant Policy as OPA Policy Engine
  participant DB as MariaDB
  participant Audit as Audit Store

  Note over SCIMClient,Audit: Create User
  SCIMClient->>API: POST /scim/v2/Users
  Note over SCIMClient: Headers: X-Tenant-Id, X-Actor-Id

  API->>Validator: Validate SCIM schema
  Validator->>API: Schema valid (or 400 error)

  API->>Policy: Check provision authorization
  Policy->>API: Allow decision

  API->>Service: createUser(scimUser)
  Service->>Service: Map SCIM to ExternalUser entity
  Service->>Service: Set tenant_id from context
  Service->>Service: Set externalId, generate broker ID

  Service->>DB: INSERT INTO external_users
  DB->>Service: User created

  Service->>Audit: Write USER_CREATED event
  Service->>API: Build SCIM response with meta

  API->>SCIMClient: 201 Created (SCIM JSON)
  Note over SCIMClient: Response includes id, meta.location

  Note over SCIMClient,Audit: Update User
  SCIMClient->>API: PUT /scim/v2/Users/{id} (full replace)
  API->>Validator: Validate schema
  Validator->>API: Schema valid
  API->>Service: updateUser(id, scimUser)
  Service->>DB: UPDATE external_users SET ... WHERE id=:id AND tenant_id=:tid
  DB->>Service: Row updated
  Service->>Audit: Write USER_UPDATED event
  API->>SCIMClient: 200 OK (updated SCIM JSON)

  Note over SCIMClient,Audit: Deactivate User
  SCIMClient->>API: DELETE /scim/v2/Users/{id}
  API->>Service: deactivateUser(id)
  Service->>DB: UPDATE external_users SET active=false WHERE id=:id AND tenant_id=:tid
  DB->>Service: User deactivated
  Service->>Audit: Write USER_DEACTIVATED event
  API->>SCIMClient: 204 No Content
